{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Enrolls a signature‑based authentication method."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enrollUserPresence","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"savePrivateKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.ibm.verify.ios.sdk\/documentation\/Core\/SecKeyAddType","preciseIdentifier":"s:4Core13SecKeyAddTypeO","text":"SecKeyAddType","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"savePrivateKey","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A closure that receives the generated private key wrapped in a ","type":"text"},{"code":"SecKeyAddType","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and returns the label under which the key was stored. The closure may throw if storage fails.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The function generates a new private\/public key pair, stores the private key using the provided storage function, and then performs the enrollment using the resulting key name and public key."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The caller supplies a ","type":"text"},{"code":"savePrivateKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" closure, which receives a ","type":"text"},{"code":"SecKeyAddType","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" describing the private key that should be persisted. In this enrollment flow, the closure will always be invoked with ","type":"text"},{"code":"SecKeyAddType.key","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", containing:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"the raw private key data ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Data"},{"type":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"the key size in bits"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"the algorithm used to generate the key"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"code":["import Core","","try await enrollUserPresence(","    savePrivateKey: { key in","        \/\/ We know only `.key` will be passed","        guard case let .key(value, size, algorithm) = key else {","            throw MFARegistrationError.invalidRegistrationData(reason: \"Expected SecKeyAddType.key but received a different case.\")","        }","","        \/\/ Generate a unique label for the key","        let keyLabel = \"\\(UUID().uuidString).userPresence\"","","        try KeychainService.default.addItem(keyLabel, value: .key(value: value, size: size, algorithm: algorithm))","        return keyLabel","    }",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When storing the key, use ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SecAccessControlCreateFlags.userPresence"},{"text":" in your ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SecAccessControl"},{"text":" configuration. This ensures the key is protected by biometrics with automatic fallback to the device passcode, providing a smooth and secure user experience across Face ID, Touch ID, and PIN‑based verification.  See ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/documentation\/security\/secaccesscontrolcreateflags","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"style":"note","name":"Throws","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Errors related to biometric evaluation, key generation, or enrollment.","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.ibm.verify.ios.sdk\/documentation\/MFA","doc:\/\/com.ibm.verify.ios.sdk\/documentation\/MFA\/CloudRegistrationProvider"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.ibm.verify.ios.sdk\/documentation\/MFA\/CloudRegistrationProvider\/enrollUserPresence(savePrivateKey:)"},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enrollUserPresence"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"savePrivateKey"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:4Core13SecKeyAddTypeO","text":"SecKeyAddType"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"MFA"}],"externalID":"s:3MFA25CloudRegistrationProviderC18enrollUserPresence14savePrivateKeyySS4Core03SecJ7AddTypeOKXE_tYaKF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","title":"enrollUserPresence(savePrivateKey:)"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/mfa\/cloudregistrationprovider\/enrolluserpresence(saveprivatekey:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://com.ibm.verify.ios.sdk/documentation/MFA/CloudRegistrationProvider/enrollUserPresence(savePrivateKey:)":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enrollUserPresence"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"savePrivateKey"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SecKeyAddType","preciseIdentifier":"s